2026-10-10T17:32:33.8196138Z # Fail-closed, on the paths-file step's own principle: a derivation
2026-10-10T17:32:33.8196971Z # that fails must fail the step, because an empty red list read from
2026-10-10T17:32:33.8197474Z # a failed fetch is "no reds" -- the fail-open this wiring closes.
2026-10-10T17:32:33.8197851Z gh api --paginate \
